# Auto-backup of the two trees (his + agent's).
#
# Enable with:
#   crontab backup.cron          # installs / replaces your crontab (careful!)
# or manually add the line below to `crontab -e`.
#
# Runs nightly at 03:17 and keeps the last 20 snapshots per tree.
# Offsite: also rsync backups/ to a second machine or the cloud — a backup that
# only lives on the same dying box is a hope, not a plan.

# minute hour day month weekday   command
17 3 * * *    /path/to/memtree/backup.sh run >> /path/to/memtree/backups/backup.log 2>&1
